{
  "job_B9.6.7_20251003_115112": {
    "chunk_text": "ylce he sumne \u00e6\u00f0elne cyricsangere begeat, se w\u00e6s Mafa haten, se w\u00e6s on Cent on & he gehw\u00e6\u00f0er ge \u00fea cyricsangas l\u00e6rde, \u00fee hi \u00e6r ne cu\u00f0an, ge eac, \u00fea \u00f0e hi iu cu\u00f0an & mid W\u00e6s he eac sylfa Acca biscop se getydesta sangere; swylce eac he w\u00e6s on halgum gewritum se & he \u00fe\u00e6s ne blon, o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t he fram Gode mede onfeng his arf\u00e6stre wilsumnesse. W\u00e6s he \u00e6rest fram his cnihthade on geferscipe \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Bosan & Gode \u00fe\u00e6s leofan \u00c6fter \u00feon he com to Wilfri\u00f0e biscope mid hyhte beteran foresetnesse, & eall his yldo & lif on Mid \u00feone he eac swilce to Rome w\u00e6s cumende & monig nytlico \u00f0ing, \u00f0e he on his e\u00f0le ne \u00d0yssum tidum Naitan Peohta cyning, \u00f0e \u00feone nor\u00f0d\u00e6l Breotone eardia\u00f0, w\u00e6s he monad mid & he hine & his \u00f0eode gel\u00e6dde to m\u00e6rsianne & to weor\u00f0ianne \u00fea rihtgesettan tide \u00fe\u00e6re & \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t mihte mid \u00f0y maran ealdorlicnesse \u00feurhteon & gefremman, sohte he him fultum of Sende he \u00e6rendracan to \u00feam arwur\u00f0an were Ceolfri\u00f0e, se w\u00e6s abbud \u00f0\u00e6s mynstres \u00feara eadigra \u00deam abbuddome he Ceolfri\u00f0 wuldorlice fore w\u00e6s \u00e6fter Benedicte, be \u00feam we beforan s\u00e6gdon. B\u00e6d he se cyning \u00feone abbud, \u00fe\u00e6t he him sende trymmendlice stafas & gewrito, mid \u00feam he \u00f0y Swylce",
